questions.question_text:
Water is to be piped from a main storage tank to five farm outlets.
The network diagram shows the possible pipeline routes with lengths given in kilometres.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (T) at (0,2);
\coordinate (A) at (2,3.5);
\coordinate (B) at (4.5,3.5);
\coordinate (C) at (6,2);
\coordinate (D) at (4.5,0.5);
\coordinate (E) at (2,0.5);
\draw (T) -- (A) node[midway, above left] {$9$};
\draw (A) -- (B) node[midway, above] {$7$};
\draw (B) -- (C) node[midway, above right] {$10$};
\draw (C) -- (D) node[midway, below right] {$8$};
\draw (D) -- (E) node[midway, below] {$9$};
\draw (E) -- (T) node[midway, below left] {$11$};
\draw (A) -- (E) node[midway, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$6$};
\draw (B) -- (D) node[midway, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$12$};
\fill (T) circle (2.5pt) node[left] {$T$};
\fill (A) circle (2.5pt) node[above] {$A$};
\fill (B) circle (2.5pt) node[above] {$B$};
\fill (C) circle (2.5pt) node[right] {$C$};
\fill (D) circle (2.5pt) node[below] {$D$};
\fill (E) circle (2.5pt) node[below] {$E$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
What is the minimum total length of pipe required to connect all five outlets to the tank?

